{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 37, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "## Lost in Translation (and Loving It!) - My Japan Adventure\n\nJapan. The word conjures images of ancient temples, bustling cityscapes, and serene gardens. And let me tell you, it lived up to every expectation! My recent trip was a whirlwind of sensory overload in the best possible way.\n\nTokyo was a dazzling assault on the senses. Neon lights, incredible food stalls (ramen, anyone?), and the sheer energy of the crowds were captivating. I spent hours wandering through Shibuya Crossing, feeling like I was in a movie. \n\nBut it wasn't just the big cities. Exploring Kyoto felt like stepping back in time. The golden Kinkaku-ji temple shimmering on the water, the delicate beauty of the bamboo forest – it was breathtaking.  I participated in a traditional tea ceremony, a truly meditative experience.\n\nThe people were incredibly kind and helpful, even with the language barrier.  Simple gestures like bowing and offering assistance went a long way. \n\nFrom the delicious street food to the impeccable politeness, Japan is a country that truly impressed me.  It’s a place where tradition and modernity seamlessly blend, creating a unique and unforgettable experience.  I'm already dreaming of my return!\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁Lost", "logprob": -0.0017502479022368789}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.1602734625339508}, {"token": "▁Translation", "logprob": -0.0005707303644157946}, {"token": "▁(", "logprob": -0.4742133617401123}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.0007289375062100589}, {"token": "▁Loving", "logprob": -0.00025018901214934886}, {"token": "▁It", "logprob": -0.0002926159941125661}, {"token": "!)", "logprob": -0.28598496317863464}, {"token": "▁-", "logprob": -0.13361425697803497}, {"token": "▁My", "logprob": -0.2906096577644348}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.08359082043170929}, {"token": "▁Ad